# ============================================================================
# FractureFlow release .gitignore
# Double duty: (a) keep runtime junk out of git; (b) act as a POLICY GUARD --
# any file matching the data-policy / internal-material blocks below must
# never be committed, even by accident.  Rulings follow the open-source
# compliance audit (R145, 2026-08-29).
# ============================================================================

# ---- Runtime / editor junk ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.cache/
*.log
_tmp_*/
_release_checks/
data/demo/
results/demo/

# ---- Internal process artifacts (must never enter any release) ----
AGENTS.md
TASKS.md
DATA_MAP.md
tasks/
docs/架构师交接*.md
docs/技术路线_*.md
docs/伽马线_*.md
.cowork-temp/
.workbuddy/
.meituan-catpaw/
.qoder-cn/

# ---- Business / client materials (NDA, commitments, deprecated-number scripts) ----
docs/试点材料/
docs/面向客户*.md
docs/客户交付文档*.md
docs/*验收标准*
docs/*产品说明*

# ---- Internal research ledgers & artifacts ----
results/_archive*/
results/_*_backup*
results/_*_superseded*/
fmi_attr/
vision/
models/

# ---- Data policy: FORBIDDEN to distribute (hard rulings, R145 §2) ----
# Beishan pre-selection area (high-level radioactive waste disposal): any
# raw or derived site data. Also mixed-net files containing Beishan wells.
data/real/beishan_wells.npz
data/real/loaded_real_nets*.pt
# Aland traces: rights held by the authors & Geological Survey of Finland.
data/real/aland_20m.pt
data/external/aland_islands_repo/
data/external/aland_traces/
data/external/published_reports/
data/external/cnki_papers/
data/external/cnki_*.png
data/external/CNKI*.md
data/external/literature_sets.csv
data/external/EFRACTURE_DATA.md
# E-drive junction (local filesystem artifact; git cannot carry it anyway)
data/external/efracture_data
# Internal incident backups
*_complementbug.pt.bak
*.bak

# ---- Data policy: LINK-ONLY (download from the official source; do not commit) ----
data/real/forge2024_single.pt
data/real/pontrelli_*.pt
data/external/decovalex_dfn/
data/external/FORGE_16A-32_FMI_fracture_log.xlsx
data/external/FORGE_16B-32_core_fracture_analysis.zip
data/external/_forge_extract/
data/external/snake_river_INEL1/
data/external/gdr_egs_collab/
data/external/utah_forge_fmi/*.las
